WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.192
Today is something new. Two letters that make one sound.

2
00:00:03.642 --> 00:00:06.222
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:09.843
Here is the first pair. Two letters, and this one sound.

4
00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:14.303
It is a long sound. It is the name of the letter.

5
00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:18.271
See. The word is see.

6
00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:22.928
The word is keep.

7
00:00:23.828 --> 00:00:27.944
On the page, the pair has one line under it. One line, one sound.

8
00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:31.956
Your child reads with one finger under both letters of the pair.

9
00:00:32.406 --> 00:00:36.929
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

10
00:00:37.379 --> 00:00:43.085
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

11
00:00:43.535 --> 00:00:46.619
There is nothing to play today. The pictures are the check.

12
00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:49.581
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
